  # Infrastruktur-Kontext (für AI + Debugging)
  brainhome-devctl context                      (Alle Module, Topology, Cron)
  brainhome-devctl context webserver            (Fokus: webserver + Deps + Cron)
  brainhome-devctl context pihole               (Fokus: pihole + Guests + Cron)
